13
00:00:26,902 --> 00:00:28,403
[exclaims]

14
00:00:29,279 --> 00:00:30,697
[in English] I love it.

15
00:00:31,281 --> 00:00:32,783
-Wow.
-[laughs]

16
00:00:32,866 --> 00:00:34,701
