29
00:01:35,804 --> 00:01:36,805
[♪ music ends]

30
00:01:36,888 --> 00:01:39,016
This is the Durango and Silverton
Narrow Gauge Railroad.

31
00:01:39,099 --> 00:01:41,351
-[train bells ring]
-[train whistle blows]

32
00:01:45,105 --> 00:01:46,606
[bells ringing]

33
00:01:47,107 --> 00:01:48,859
[train whistle blows]

34
00:01:57,826 --> 00:02:00,662
There isn't a boy in the world
who doesn't like trains!

35
00:02:04,124 --> 00:02:05,584
[narrator] It's the special summer break

36
00:02:05,667 --> 00:02:07,419
Noel organized
for the Travis Japan members.

37
00:02:07,502 --> 00:02:11,423
At the foot of the Rocky Mountains
where the desert winds blow

38
00:02:11,506 --> 00:02:15,260
