a warm welcome for them.

44
00:02:36,281 --> 00:02:38,367
[♪ opening theme music plays]

45
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:54,675
Travis Japan
SUMMER VACATION!! IN THE USA

46
00:02:57,594 --> 00:02:59,763
