-[Genta] Thought so.

52
00:03:08,105 --> 00:03:09,690
[all laugh]

53
00:03:12,484 --> 00:03:13,735
Whoa!

54
00:03:13,819 --> 00:03:15,195
Whoa.

55
00:03:15,278 --> 00:03:16,279
Aiyaa!

56
00:03:16,363 --> 00:03:17,823
Aiyaa… Aiyaa!

57
00:03:17,906 --> 00:03:19,157
-Aiyaa.
-Aiyaa!

58
00:03:19,241 --> 00:03:20,450
-[in Japanese] Crazy!
-Sick!

59
00:03:23,954 --> 00:03:25,455
[Genta, in Japanese]
This is Disney in real life.

60
00:03:25,539 --> 00:03:27,207
-[Shime] No kidding.
-[Machu] It's unreal.

61
00:03:27,290 --> 00:03:30,001
