62
00:03:30,085 --> 00:03:31,670
[Shime, in Japanese] This is insane.

63
00:03:31,753 --> 00:03:33,296
[Machu] It must feel nice to be on board.

64
00:03:33,380 --> 00:03:35,048
-[Genta] It's just like in the movies.
-[Shime] Whoa.

65
00:03:35,132 --> 00:03:36,216
[Machu] It's a movie brought to life.

66
00:03:36,299 --> 00:03:37,801
