-[Machu] Yeah.

67
00:03:37,884 --> 00:03:40,303
[Shime] Never thought I'd see it
in real life.

68
00:03:40,387 --> 00:03:42,013
-[camera shutter clicks]
-I love it.

69
00:03:42,097 --> 00:03:43,682
-[camera shutter clicks]
-[Genta] Mmm, great pose!

70
00:03:43,765 --> 00:03:46,226
[chuckling] Hold on.
You're getting too close.

71
00:03:46,309 --> 00:03:48,019
-I love it!
-Yeah? Is it good?

72
00:03:48,103 --> 00:03:50,230
-Mmm, it suits you.
-Thanks.

73
00:03:50,313 --> 00:03:51,314
[Shime] Whoa, it's amazing.

74
00:03:51,398 --> 00:03:53,442
[Genta] Look at the maintenance worker.
Doesn't he look cool?

75
00:03:53,525 --> 00:03:54,985
-[Machu] They look cool!
-[Shime] Yep.

76
00:03:55,068 --> 00:03:59,114
Don't you think
their work clothes fit the bill?

77
00:03:59,197 --> 00:04:00,657
[Machu] It does.
I'm digging their overalls.

78
00:04:00,740 --> 00:04:02,742
