the original purpose of denim.

79
00:04:02,826 --> 00:04:04,828
-[Shime] Oh, really? I didn't know.
-[Genta] That's right.

80
00:04:04,911 --> 00:04:07,622
It was made to be
worn by workers at first.

81
00:04:07,706 --> 00:04:09,291
[Shime] Is that right?

82
00:04:09,374 --> 00:04:11,168
-Cool.
-Well, leader, what do you say

83
00:04:11,251 --> 00:04:14,463
-to taking a close look from the front?
-Wanna go look at the head?

84
00:04:14,546 --> 00:04:15,881
-All the way up there?
-Yep.

85
00:04:15,964 --> 00:04:18,133
-Wanna get right up to it?
-Shall we walk that way?

86
00:04:18,216 --> 00:04:19,759
-Let's see how close we can get.
-Should we?

87
00:04:19,843 --> 00:04:21,219
-Yeah.
-Since we're here, why not?

88
00:04:21,303 --> 00:04:22,304
Good point.

89
00:04:24,347 --> 00:04:25,432
What a beast of a machine.

90
00:04:25,515 --> 00:04:27,601
-It's seriously wild.
-Yeah, this is incredible.

91
00:04:27,684 --> 00:04:29,895
-Just wow.
-[Genta] How fascinating.

92
00:04:32,397 --> 00:04:33,482
Have a safe trip!

93
00:04:33,565 --> 00:04:35,066
See you! Bye-bye!

94
00:04:35,150 --> 00:04:36,651
[train whistle blows]

95
00:04:37,611 --> 00:04:39,112
-[Genta] Amazing.
-[Shime] It's seriously cool.

96
00:04:39,196 --> 00:04:40,947
[train whistle blows]

97
00:04:43,867 --> 00:04:46,161
-[Machu] Whoa.
-[Shime] It's amazing, really.

98
00:04:46,244 --> 00:04:48,580
-[Machu] It packs a punch!
-[Shime] Oh, look. They're waving at us.

99
00:04:48,663 --> 00:04:50,415
[train whistle blows]

100
00:04:52,459 --> 00:04:53,460
[Genta] Bye-bye!

101
00:04:54,586 --> 00:04:55,921
[Machu cheers]

102
00:04:56,922 --> 00:04:58,089
[Machu, in English] Yeah!

103
00:04:58,173 --> 00:05:00,759
-[Genta, in Japanese] Wow.
-[Machu] It goes on forever.

104
00:05:00,842 --> 00:05:02,469
-[Genta] It's so long.
-[Machu] It keeps going too.

105
00:05:02,552 --> 00:05:04,805
[Shime] So many compartments
strung together.

106
00:05:04,888 --> 00:05:06,723
-Everyone's waving at us.
-[Genta] Have a safe trip, everyone!

107
00:05:07,849 --> 00:05:09,434
