110
00:05:15,232 --> 00:05:16,983
-[Genta, in English] Oh, yeah!
-Oh, yeah!

111
00:05:17,067 --> 00:05:20,237
-Oh, yeah!
-[cheers] Yeah!

112
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:21,571
[Genta, in Japanese] Docking! [cheers]

113
00:05:21,655 --> 00:05:22,697
[Machu] Docking.

114
00:05:22,781 --> 00:05:24,282
[Shime, in English] Yeah!

115
00:05:24,366 --> 00:05:25,700
[train bells ringing]

116
00:05:26,284 --> 00:05:28,119
-[in Japanese] Now I'm hyped.
-Seriously, yeah.

117
00:05:28,203 --> 00:05:29,204
What a treat.

118
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:32,541
-They're selling helmets, Shime.
-Oh, actually?

119
00:05:32,624 --> 00:05:34,251
-Helmets.
-You're right.

120
00:05:36,169 --> 00:05:38,171
[♪ playful, upbeat music playing]

121
00:05:41,466 --> 00:05:42,551
[Genta] It suits you.

122
00:05:42,634 --> 00:05:43,635
-I love it.
-Nice.

123
00:05:43,718 --> 00:05:45,762
[Genta] Nice.
You two should definitely buy it.

124
00:05:45,846 --> 00:05:47,556
-[Machu] It's your colors too.
-It's my TJ color.

125
00:05:47,639 --> 00:05:48,640
Look at this tiny one.

126
00:05:48,723 --> 00:05:52,602
