128
00:05:56,857 --> 00:05:58,024
[Genta] Knew it.

129
00:05:58,108 --> 00:06:01,111
Are those collectibles?
Shime, you've got like 800 mugs at home.

130
00:06:01,194 --> 00:06:03,071
