-[Genta] Nice.

449
00:19:58,948 --> 00:20:00,241
…what guys a hundred and--

450
00:20:00,324 --> 00:20:03,411
140 years ago would've been wearing
on this branch line.

451
00:20:03,494 --> 00:20:05,621
