from the time I was a little kid.

461
00:20:31,647 --> 00:20:34,692
And the fact that
I get to come to work every day

462
00:20:34,775 --> 00:20:38,571
and do something that I absolutely love
is really, really great.

463
00:20:39,155 --> 00:20:41,991
