464
00:20:42,074 --> 00:20:47,371
[in English] This train has been
running continuously for 143 years.

465
00:20:47,455 --> 00:20:50,332
-[Genta] Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.
-This line was opened in 1882

466
00:20:50,416 --> 00:20:54,462
